{"type":"message","id":"0b2b798d","parentId":"7839420c","timestamp":"2026-05-28T20:03:39.778Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_ac798a5108ee4a48bd4cf7c1","toolName":"web_search","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"query\": \"Cloudflare Workers error code 1101\",\n  \"provider\": \"duckduckgo\",\n  \"count\": 5,\n  \"tookMs\": 1062,\n  \"externalContent\": {\n    \"untrusted\": true,\n    \"source\": \"web_search\",\n    \"provider\": \"duckduckgo\",\n    \"wrapped\": true\n  },\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"75d61739550f1dac\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nError 1101 · Cloudflare Support docs\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"75d61739550f1dac\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://developers.cloudflare.com/support/troubleshooting/http-status-codes/cloudflare-1xxx-errors/error-1101/\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"6d1c8f3fde2543f4\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nTroubleshoot Cloudflare 1101 error code . This error typically occurs when a Cloudflare Worker encounters a runtime JavaScript exception.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"6d1c8f3fde2543f4\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"developers.cloudflare.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"1a33d8e1ea8861f2\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nCloudflare Error 1101: Worker Threw Exception | Unknown Proxies\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"1a33d8e1ea8861f2\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://unknownproxies.com/blog/error-codes/cloudflare-error-1101-worker-exception\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"f775ded836db5db0\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nCloudflare Error 1101 means a Worker threw an exception or failed to return a response. Learn causes, debugging steps, and fixes.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"f775ded836db5db0\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"unknownproxies.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"1f0f4c07ddbc239a\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nFix Cloudflare Error 1101 - Worker Exception Solution\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"1f0f4c07ddbc239a\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.fdaytalk.com/cloudflare-error-1101/\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"34f4905b4df2fe15\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nError 1101 is a clear sign that your Cloudflare Worker has encountered an unhandled exception. By methodically reviewing your Worker's logs, debugging your code locally, and following the troubleshooting steps provided above, you can identify and fix the underlying issue.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"34f4905b4df2fe15\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.fdaytalk.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"5aefc49c188e3a10\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nError 1101: \\\"Worker threw exception\\\" in Payment Response\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"5aefc49c188e3a10\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://developer.squareup.com/forums/t/error-1101-worker-threw-exception-in-payment-response/22840\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"7624fdb1b6db8c95\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nThe error code 1101 , along with the message \\\" Worker threw exception,\\\" indicates that there was an issue with a Cloudflare worker script that is responsible for processing the request.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"7624fdb1b6db8c95\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"developer.squareup.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"1e5bfeda9d4601f6\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nHow to Fix CloudFlare Error 1101 (Worker threw exception)?\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"1e5bfeda9d4601f6\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://helloacm.com/how-to-fix-cloudflare-error-1101-worker-threw-exception/\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"c4525953f0ff4f8a\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nHow to Fix CloudFlare Error 1101 ( Worker threw exception)? This usually happens, when the script throws a Javascript exception, and can be handled by Try-Catch.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"c4525953f0ff4f8a\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"helloacm.com\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}],"details":{"query":"Cloudflare Workers error code 1101","provider":"duckduckgo","count":5,"tookMs":1062,"externalContent":{"untrusted":true,"source":"web_search","provider":"duckduckgo","wrapped":true},"results":[{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"75d61739550f1dac\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nError 1101 · Cloudflare Support docs\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"75d61739550f1dac\">>>","url":"https://developers.cloudflare.com/support/troubleshooting/http-status-codes/cloudflare-1xxx-errors/error-1101/","snippet":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"6d1c8f3fde2543f4\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nTroubleshoot Cloudflare 1101 error code . This error typically occurs when a Cloudflare Worker encounters a runtime JavaScript exception.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"6d1c8f3fde2543f4\">>>","siteName":"developers.cloudflare.com"},{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"1a33d8e1ea8861f2\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nCloudflare Error 1101: Worker Threw Exception | Unknown Proxies\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"1a33d8e1ea8861f2\">>>","url":"https://unknownproxies.com/blog/error-codes/cloudflare-error-1101-worker-exception","snippet":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"f775ded836db5db0\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nCloudflare Error 1101 means a Worker threw an exception or failed to return a response. Learn causes, debugging steps, and fixes.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"f775ded836db5db0\">>>","siteName":"unknownproxies.com"},{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"1f0f4c07ddbc239a\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nFix Cloudflare Error 1101 - Worker Exception Solution\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"1f0f4c07ddbc239a\">>>","url":"https://www.fdaytalk.com/cloudflare-error-1101/","snippet":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"34f4905b4df2fe15\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nError 1101 is a clear sign that your Cloudflare Worker has encountered an unhandled exception. By methodically reviewing your Worker's logs, debugging your code locally, and following the troubleshooting steps provided above, you can identify and fix the underlying issue.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"34f4905b4df2fe15\">>>","siteName":"www.fdaytalk.com"},{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"5aefc49c188e3a10\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nError 1101: \"Worker threw exception\" in Payment Response\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"5aefc49c188e3a10\">>>","url":"https://developer.squareup.com/forums/t/error-1101-worker-threw-exception-in-payment-response/22840","snippet":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"7624fdb1b6db8c95\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nThe error code 1101 , along with the message \" Worker threw exception,\" indicates that there was an issue with a Cloudflare worker script that is responsible for processing the request.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"7624fdb1b6db8c95\">>>","siteName":"developer.squareup.com"},{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"1e5bfeda9d4601f6\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nHow to Fix CloudFlare Error 1101 (Worker threw exception)?\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"1e5bfeda9d4601f6\">>>","url":"https://helloacm.com/how-to-fix-cloudflare-error-1101-worker-threw-exception/","snippet":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"c4525953f0ff4f8a\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nHow to Fix CloudFlare Error 1101 ( Worker threw exception)? This usually happens, when the script throws a Javascript exception, and can be handled by Try-Catch.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"c4525953f0ff4f8a\">>>","siteName":"helloacm.com"}]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779998619767}}
